@startuml
!include _style.puml
title Durable effects — outbox и периодическая maintenance
participant "API use case" as API
participant "Outbox enqueue" as Queue
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
participant "Worker / all runtime\nmaintenance-jobs" as Worker
database "Redis" as Redis
participant "Mailer / Notification writer" as Delivery
API -> PG : business mutation
API -> Queue : enqueue(payload, event identity, manager?)
Queue -> Queue : transformer.to(payload)\nemail blind index + encrypted PII
Queue -> PG : INSERT pending encrypted JSONB\nON CONFLICT idempotency DO NOTHING
Queue -> PG : findOne by idempotency key
PG --> Queue : decoded entity / existing event
note over API, PG
  Переданный EntityManager позволяет общий business transaction.
  Для новой сметы notification key включает persisted quote ID;
  retry одной версии дедуплицируется, разные версии независимы.
  Provider invitation и email.send с encryptedToken ставятся
  в одной transaction; enqueue failure откатывает приглашение.
  Safely/after-commit callers нужно проверять отдельно.
  Raw INSERT вызывает transformer явно до записи.
  Миграция 178642 шифрует legacy plaintext recipients;
  сохранность ключей и production backfill проверяются отдельно.
end note
loop scheduled cycle (60s interval)
  Worker -> Redis : acquire / renew maintenance lease
  alt lease acquired
    Worker -> PG : recover stale locks / claim outbox batch
    PG --> Worker : processing events
    Worker -> Delivery : bounded payload / template validation
    note right of Delivery
      Provider invitation email содержит одноразовую ссылку;
      после успеха encryptedToken удаляется из outbox payload.
    end note
    alt dispatched
      Delivery -> PG : notification row (if notification event)
      Delivery --> Worker : mail/notification result
      Worker -> PG : completed / secret redaction
    else retryable failure
      Worker -> PG : failed + backoff / attempts
    else exhausted or terminal failure
      Worker -> PG : dead_letter + incident/metrics
    end
    Worker -> PG : reminders / quote expiry / auth cleanup\naudit retention / orphan cleanup
    Worker -> PG : trust due candidates\nNULLS FIRST + attemptedAt retry backoff
    loop each bounded provider
      Worker -> PG : recompute trust; advance successful watermark
      note right of Worker
        N25: unchanged scores still advance watermark.
        Failed provider only advances attemptedAt;
        next provider continues, cycle reports partial.
      end note
    end
  end
end
note over Worker, Delivery
  Claim/lease дают повторную обработку при сбое.
  Event identity и downstream idempotency требуют проверки.
  Quote notification key различает версии; production delivery
  и downstream deduplication ещё не подтверждены.
end note
footer outbox.service.ts / maintenance-jobs.service.ts / maintenance-lease.service.ts
@enduml
